  "contentHtml": "<p>달크기&#160;측정&#160;팝업&#160;학습지</p><p>달크기측정팝업학습지.hwp</p><p>0.25MB</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">달 크기를 별다른 도구 없이 쉽게 측정하게 하기 위해 달크기 측정용 팝업 학습지를 만들어 보았다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">만드는 방법 및 활동방법은 동영상 참고</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/pewpMQHei6I\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/pewpMQHei6I</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pewpMQHei6I\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/RH9Oj/hySF24vK7W/MiKKL8Qo6jWbKFC3LRkMSk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pewpMQHei6I\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>* 동영상과 달리 먼저 활동지를 3번 접어서 막대 모양으로 만들고, 그 다음 가위로 자르는 것이 좋다.&#160; 가위로 먼저 잘라 놓았더니, 잘 접지 못하는 학생들이 있다.&#160;</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>달크기는&#160;삼각형의&#160;닮은비만&#160;알면&#160;쉽게&#160;측정할&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;<br>전형적인&#160;실험의&#160;경우&#160;50cm&#160;자에&#160;구멍이&#160;뚫린&#160;종이를&#160;끼워서&#160;달의&#160;크기를&#160;측정한다.<br><br><br>학생들&#160;수&#160;만큼&#160;50cm&#160;자를&#160;준비하는&#160;것은&#160;쉬운일이&#160;아니다.&#160;그래서&#160;학습지&#160;하나만&#160;가지고&#160;실험하는&#160;방법을&#160;생각해&#160;보았다.<br>어렵지&#160;않은&#160;실험이라&#160;학습지&#160;자체를&#160;측정도구로&#160;사용하게&#160;만들었다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br><b>&lt;학습지&#160;제작&#160;방법&gt;</b><br><br>1.&#160;일단&#160;학습지를&#160;절반으로&#160;접고&#160;그걸&#160;또다시&#160;절반으로&#160;접는다.&#160;한번&#160;더&#160;절반으로&#160;접으면&#160;학습지가&#160;단단한&#160;종이자가&#160;된다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c54b2e3d23c6a743e04dda510d4fd6ca112f804\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c54b2e3d23c6a743e04dda510d4fd6ca112f804\" data-origin-width=\"1803\" data-origin-height=\"566\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br><br>2.&#160;눈에&#160;가져다&#160;댈&#160;종이자의&#160;끝부분을&#160;접는다.&#160;<br>&#160;-처음에는&#160;자처럼&#160;사용하려고&#160;했으나,&#160;아무래도&#160;눈에&#160;가까이&#160;하는&#160;거라&#160;잘못하면&#160;종이에&#160;눈을&#160;찔릴&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;안전사고를&#160;예방하기&#160;위해&#160;끝부분을&#160;접게&#160;했다.&#160;끝부분을&#160;접으면&#160;손으로&#160;잡기도&#160;편하고&#160;접은&#160;부분을&#160;눈&#160;아래&#160;고정시켜&#160;주면&#160;되기&#160;때문에&#160;안전하고&#160;실험도&#160;편리하다.<br>&#160;-&#160;종이자&#160;끝부분을&#160;접으면&#160;눈에&#160;가져다&#160;대는&#160;부분부터&#160;자&#160;눈금&#160;0&#160;이&#160;시작된다.&#160;<br><br>3.&#160;종이자&#160;윗부분&#160;실선을&#160;가위로&#160;잘라&#160;종이막대를&#160;만들고,&#160;종이막대&#160;끝&#160;구멍을&#160;펀치로&#160;뚫어&#160;준다.&#160;<br>&#160;-&#160;다&#160;잘라내면,&#160;나중에&#160;종이&#160;막대를&#160;잃어버리거나,&#160;휴지가&#160;될&#160;수&#160;있기&#160;때문에&#160;잘라내지&#160;않고,&#160;접을&#160;수&#160;있게&#160;만들었다.<br>&#160;-&#160;실선부분을&#160;미리&#160;잘라내도&#160;되지만,&#160;만들어&#160;보니&#160;미리&#160;자르면&#160;종이를&#160;접는&#160;동안&#160;파손되는&#160;경우가&#160;생길&#160;수&#160;있다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54ed86cb23c37d64ec2b3a0ca680bc36c49f85aa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54ed86cb23c37d64ec2b3a0ca680bc36c49f85aa\" data-origin-width=\"1138\" data-origin-height=\"583\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>4.&#160;접은&#160;부분을&#160;눈에&#160;대고&#160;종이막대를&#160;손가락&#160;검지와&#160;중지&#160;사이에&#160;끼워&#160;넣고,&#160;앞뒤로&#160;움직여&#160;가며&#160;관찰하면&#160;된다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/045bbf39bfd492afaa0145886b1b13aab3c4f58f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/045bbf39bfd492afaa0145886b1b13aab3c4f58f\" data-origin-width=\"928\" data-origin-height=\"510\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br><br>5.&#160;구멍과&#160;모형달의&#160;크기가&#160;일치하면&#160;종이막대의&#160;위치를&#160;학습지를&#160;보고&#160;알아내면&#160;된다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29a21bc2acb5bd0cf8ce800356998c924d66ac81\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29a21bc2acb5bd0cf8ce800356998c924d66ac81\" data-origin-width=\"1015\" data-origin-height=\"460\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br><br><b>&lt;달&#160;크기&#160;측정&#160;:&#160;모형달을&#160;제시하고&#160;측정하게&#160;하면&#160;된다.&gt;</b><br><br>펀치&#160;구멍&#160;크기는&#160;0.6&#160;cm&#160;다.<br>종이&#160;막대를&#160;앞뒤로&#160;움직이면&#160;학습지에&#160;자를&#160;표시해&#160;놓았기&#160;때문에&#160;눈에서&#160;자까지의&#160;거리도&#160;쉽게&#160;알&#160;수&#160;있다.<br>눈에서&#160;모형달까지의&#160;거리를&#160;측정한&#160;후<br>모형달의&#160;크기를&#160;계산하면&#160;된다.&#160;<br>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c19bff58525fbdd498e2b6e5c4734c5e459954f1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c19bff58525fbdd498e2b6e5c4734c5e459954f1\" data-origin-width=\"1065\" data-origin-height=\"514\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<br><br><b>&lt;학교높이&#160;측정&#160;:&#160;운동장에&#160;나가서&#160;학교&#160;높이&#160;측정하기&gt;</b><br><br>같은원리로&#160;학교&#160;높이도&#160;측정할&#160;수&#160;있다.<br><br>종이막대의&#160;높이는&#160;약&#160;4cm&#160;이다.<br>따라서&#160;종이막대를&#160;앞뒤로&#160;움직여&#160;건물의&#160;꼭대기와&#160;종이막대&#160;꼭대기를&#160;일치시키면&#160;된다.<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/841bdeb27579d53045ff3293ac5688ed13ccce0a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/841bdeb27579d53045ff3293ac5688ed13ccce0a\" data-origin-width=\"1069\" data-origin-height=\"568\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br>종이막대를 접어서 세우면 종이막대 높이는 4cm 가 된다.&#160;<br>종이막대&#160;끝을&#160;학교&#160;건물&#160;끝에&#160;맞추고,&#160;눈에서&#160;종이막대까지의&#160;거리를&#160;측정한다.<br>그리고&#160;관측자로부터&#160;건물까지의&#160;거리를&#160;측정하면,&#160;삼각형&#160;닮은비에&#160;의해&#160;건물높이를&#160;알아낼&#160;수&#160;있다.<br><br><br><b>&lt;그밖에 달 크기 측정에 대한 또다른 생각&gt;</b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>자와&#160;집게와&#160;자석과&#160;종이&#160;이용</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42b32ab900716f88e5327f684cc587e5d84e5b24\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42b32ab900716f88e5327f684cc587e5d84e5b24\" data-origin-width=\"1123\" data-origin-height=\"653\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br>자와&#160;집게와&#160;자석과&#160;쇠구슬&#160;이용</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56ab41e3438e8b82f7460420f08749334bce3aaa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56ab41e3438e8b82f7460420f08749334bce3aaa\" data-origin-width=\"1122\" data-origin-height=\"565\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><br><br>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">달크기 측정 가상실험</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2131\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/2131</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"달의 크기 측정 프로그램 - 시지름 이용\" data-og-description=\"시지름을 이용하여 달의 크기를 측정하는 프로그램입니다. 눈앞에 있는 가림막의 위치와 달의 위치를 드래그 해서 이동시킬 수 있습니다. 또 눈앞에 있는 가림막의 구멍 크기를 조절할 수 있습\" data-og-host=\"sciencelove.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2131\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2131\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/eAjG5C/hySF9owucO/YXr3UKjxaHNY8avpLDKN9k/img.png?width=630&amp;height=473&amp;face=0_0_630_473,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dwp9t4/hySE43suYu/9BfERrBWB5YJU8rKmG1JUk/img.png?width=630&amp;height=473&amp;face=0_0_630_473,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/btEVDD/hySE16JRA2/4lmGmkXNkSwYWNK1pWqwv1/img.png?width=630&amp;height=473&amp;face=0_0_630_473\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2131\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/2131\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/eAjG5C/hySF9owucO/YXr3UKjxaHNY8avpLDKN9k/img.png?width=630&amp;height=473&amp;face=0_0_630_473,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dwp9t4/hySE43suYu/9BfERrBWB5YJU8rKmG1JUk/img.png?width=630&amp;height=473&amp;face=0_0_630_473,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/btEVDD/hySE16JRA2/4lmGmkXNkSwYWNK1pWqwv1/img.png?width=630&amp;height=473&amp;face=0_0_630_473)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">달의 크기 측정 프로그램 - 시지름 이용</p><p class=\"og-desc\">시지름을 이용하여 달의 크기를 측정하는 프로그램입니다. 눈앞에 있는 가림막의 위치와 달의 위치를 드래그 해서 이동시킬 수 있습니다. 또 눈앞에 있는 가림막의 구멍 크기를 조절할 수 있습</p><p class=\"og-host\">sciencelove.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">지구크기 측정 팝업 학습지</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/1120\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/1120</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"에라토스테네스의 지구크기 측정 학습지\" data-og-description=\"에라토스테네스가 측정했던 지구 측정방법을 학습지로 만들어 보았습니다. 학습지를 개인별로 (제가 보기엔 2명이 함께 하면 서로 종이를 잡아 줄 수 있어서 더 좋을 것 같습니다.) 출력해서 굵\" data-og-host=\"sciencelove.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1120\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1120\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ctFUj8/hySFYVk0E7/IILzZStjrBCOqtxIhOiwg1/img.jpg?width=630&amp;height=472&amp;face=0_0_630_472,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ba9Bh1/hySF57ZY4X/tS88KfpBkbACNXPjtfIdY0/img.jpg?width=630&amp;height=472&amp;face=0_0_630_472,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/60ONU/hySGceYTS1/p4ib00XZpBhVlz2QGu6241/img.jpg?width=630&amp;height=472&amp;face=0_0_630_472\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/1120\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1120\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ctFUj8/hySFYVk0E7/IILzZStjrBCOqtxIhOiwg1/img.jpg?width=630&amp;height=472&amp;face=0_0_630_472,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ba9Bh1/hySF57ZY4X/tS88KfpBkbACNXPjtfIdY0/img.jpg?width=630&amp;height=472&amp;face=0_0_630_472,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/60ONU/hySGceYTS1/p4ib00XZpBhVlz2QGu6241/img.jpg?width=630&amp;height=472&amp;face=0_0_630_472)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">에라토스테네스의 지구크기 측정 학습지</p><p class=\"og-desc\">에라토스테네스가 측정했던 지구 측정방법을 학습지로 만들어 보았습니다. 학습지를 개인별로 (제가 보기엔 2명이 함께 하면 서로 종이를 잡아 줄 수 있어서 더 좋을 것 같습니다.) 출력해서 굵</p><p class=\"og-host\">sciencelove.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
